[[eco-freezing]]
=== Freezing and execution environments

**STUB**: Specifies freezing: turning an environment and its installed programs
into a portable artifact that runs on another machine. Defines what a frozen
artifact contains, what it may assume of the host, and which features a slim
artifact gives up. Covers container execution and cluster execution (resource
labels and job submission), and the requirements an execution environment must
meet to run a program.

